Z||000000||3fifty||08-28-2001||09:49 PM||||Just out of curiosity, what does your autos<BR>shift at? My 85 GT 2.8 auto shifts at 4k.<P>Thanks,<BR>3fifty one day !!!! ||||reg||5
Z||000001||grinthock||08-28-2001||10:56 PM||||My 87 shifts wherever I want it too...  <P>Try this<P>1)  go to WOT (wide open throttle)<P>2)  When you want it to shift, EASE off a bit<P>3)  After it has finished shifted go BACK to WOT.<P><BR>It's kinda like shifting a auto manually, DO NOT do the 1-2-d thing, it's stupid<P>------------------<BR> <A HREF="http://www.fieroworld.com" TARGET=_blank> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroworldbanner.gif"> </A> <BR>Fieroworld!  Home of my 87 GT and 85 GT<BR>Justin C.<BR>Engineer, Designer and<BR>Technical Trainer for Nortel Networks Business Products.||||reg||1
